Package: dev.rtrdd.toprow
Name: TopRow
Version: 2.1.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: A number row on top, and every key your way
 Adds a number row to the top of the stock iOS keyboard: 1-0 on letters,
 !@#$%^&*() with shift or caps lock, and an extra symbol row on 123. Every
 other key is yours too: retype, add, remove or reorder the keys on the
 letters, Shift, 123 and #+= pages. Key height, bottom area, landscape,
 per-app and per-keyboard-type options, all applied live. iPhone only.
 Free and open source.
Maintainer: aay <275768457+aayy-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
Author: aay <275768457+aayy-dev@users.noreply.github.com>
